#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.rst:2
msgid "nanprod"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:1
msgid ""
"Compute the product of tensor elements along specified dimensions, "
"ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN 値を無視して、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の積を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:4
msgid ""
"This function calculates the product of all valid (non-NaN) elements in a"
" tensor along the specified dimension(s). Unlike ``numpy.nanprod``, which"
" returns 1 when no valid elements are found, this function returns NaN "
"for slices that contain no valid values, following the convention of "
":func:`nansum`. This behavior is more mathematically consistent for "
"statistical operations where the absence of data should be explicitly "
"represented as NaN."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル内のすべての有効な要素（NaN でない値）の積を計算します。有効な要素が存在しない場合に 1 を返す ``numpy.nanprod`` とは異なり、この関数は :func:`nansum` の慣例に従い、有効な値を含まないスライスに対して NaN を返します。この動作は、統計処理においてデータの欠如を明示的に NaN として表現する必要がある場合に、より数学的に整合性が取れています。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:12
msgid "The NaN-aware product is computed as:"
msgstr "NaN を考慮した積は以下のように計算されます："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:14
msgid ""
"\\text{nanprod}(X) = \\prod_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanprod}(X) = \\prod_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:17
msgid "where the product is over all valid (non-NaN) values."
msgstr "ここで、積は有効な（NaN でない）すべての値に対して計算されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:20
msgid "The input tensor containing values."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:23
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the product. If None (default), "
"the product is computed over all dimensions. A tuple must contain at "
"least one dimension."
msgstr "積を計算する次元を指定します。None（デフォルト）の場合は、すべての次元にわたって積が計算されます。タプルには少なくとも 1 つの次元を含める必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:28
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:32
msgid ""
"The product values computed only over valid (non-NaN) values. When no "
"valid values exist along a dimension, the result is NaN (unlike "
"``numpy.nanprod`` which returns 1). The shape depends on the input "
"dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` parameters."
msgstr "この積は、有効な値（NaN でない値）のみに対して計算されます。指定した次元に沿って有効な値が存在しない場合、結果は NaN となります（``numpy.nanprod`` のように 1 を返すことはありません）。出力の形状は、入力の次元、:attr:`dim` パラメータ、および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:40
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:42
msgid ""
">>> # Simple product with NaN values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, nan, 3.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x)\n"
"tensor(6.)"
msgstr ""
">>> # NaN 値を含む単純な積\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([2.0, nan, 3.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x)\n"
"tensor(6.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:47
msgid ""
">>> # All-NaN slices return NaN (numpy.nanprod would return 1)\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[2.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([6., nan])"
msgstr ""
">>> # すべて NaN のスライスは NaN を返す（numpy.nanprod は 1 を返す）\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[2.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([6., nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:53
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with product along columns\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([4., 5., 3.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 2 次元テンソルの列方向の積\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([4., 5., 3.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:59
msgid ""
">>> # With keepdim\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[ 3.],\n"
"        [20.]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # keepdim を使用\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[ 3.],\n"
"        [20.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:64
msgid ""
">>> # Multiple dimensions\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n"
"...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([12., 42.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 複数の次元\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n"
"...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanprod(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([12., 42.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:70
msgid ""
"Zeros and infinities are valid values: a slice containing both ``0`` and "
"``inf`` yields NaN because ``0 * inf`` is NaN under IEEE 754 arithmetic. "
"Only NaN values are skipped."
msgstr "ゼロや無限大は有効な値です。``0`` と ``inf`` の両方を含むスライスは、IEEE 754 の規則に従い ``0 * inf`` が NaN となるため、結果は NaN になります。スキップされるのは NaN 値のみです。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:75
msgid ""
"When all values along a dimension are NaN, this function returns NaN (not"
" 1 like ``numpy.nanprod``). This behavior difference should be considered"
" when replacing ``numpy.nanprod`` with this function."
msgstr "次元に沿ってすべての値が NaN の場合、この関数は NaN を返します（``numpy.nanprod`` のように 1 を返すことはありません）。この動作の違いは、``numpy.nanprod`` をこの関数で置き換える際に考慮する必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:81
msgid ":func:`nansum`: NaN-aware sum function."
msgstr ":func:`nansum`: NaN を考慮した和関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:82
msgid ":func:`nancumprod`: NaN-aware cumulative product function."
msgstr ":func:`nancumprod`: NaN を考慮した累積積関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanprod.nanprod:83
msgid ":func:`nanmean`: NaN-aware mean function."
msgstr ":func:`nanmean`: NaN を考慮した平均関数。"

